00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,700
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) The princess is stuck in the tower.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,460
A dragon will eat her soon.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,620
The king and queen are sad.

4
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,880
They offer to give money to the person

5
