who saves her.

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:16,260
They put up posters around town.

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,960
A poor farmer sees it.

8
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,220
He climbs up the tower.

9
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,140
He gets the princess.

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,560
He takes her to his horse.

11
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,680
They ride back to town.
